#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/cisco_aci.rst:9
msgid ""
"Cisco Application Centric Infrastructure (ACI) is a software-defined "
"networking (SDN) solution that provides centralized automation and "
"policy-driven application profiles. |morpheus| offers a comprehensive "
"integration with Cisco ACI as both a network and security integration, "
"enabling inventory of existing ACI configurations and creation of new "
"networking constructs directly from the |morpheus| UI."
msgstr ""
"Cisco Application Centric Infrastructure (ACI) es un software-definido "
"networking (SDN) solution que provides centralized automation y policy-"
"driven application profiles. |morpheus| offers un comprehensive "
"integration con Cisco ACI as both una red y security integration, "
"enabling inventory of existente ACI configurations y creation of nuevo "
"networking constructs directly desde el |morpheus| UI."

